2026-10-29 03:36:04,461 [INFO]     pivots > 20pt (price in clear space, not hugging a pivot). "cross" = bar
2026-10-29 03:36:04,461 [INFO]     open & close on opposite sides of VWAP. Pivots = classic floor-trader pivots
2026-10-29 03:36:04,461 [INFO]     from the prior trading day's H/L/C. If wrong, adjust compute_classic_pivots()
